It may use a structurally different presentation from NODE-OS Files.

Do not copy the NODE-OS Files UI merely to save implementation effort if the
approved foreign Firmware design calls for a different interaction model.

Presentation state such as:

- selected path
- selected file
- expanded directory

may remain UI-local.

Filesystem truth must not.


10. SAME REMOTE FILESYSTEM, TWO FOREIGN INTERFACES

